OL,3,GNEWSANottingham Forest stadium
OL,4,Aexpansion approved - so what now?
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor Nottingham Forest fans, this has
OL,7,Fbeen a long time coming.
OL,9,FThe last time the City Ground saw any
OL,10,Fmajor redevelopment work, Stuart Pearce
OL,11,Fand Stan Collymore still played for the
OL,12,FReds.
OL,14,FWith the ground regularly reaching
OL,15,Fcapacity since returning to the Premier
OL,16,FLeague, the club's case for expansion
OL,17,Fseems pretty clear.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
