OL,3,GNEWSANottingham Forest stadium
OL,4,Aexpansion approved - so what now?
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut there has been talk of
OL,7,Fredevelopment for at least seven years
OL,8,Fnow, and besides the addition of a
OL,9,Ftemporary stand made of shipping
OL,10,Fcontainers and some cosmetic
OL,11,Fimprovements, the stadium remains much
OL,12,Fas it was in the mid-90s.
